<p>I'm Nick Tantillo. I run <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicholas-tantillo-74493b120/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full Service Full Stack, LLC</a> out of Trenton, NJ and pull double duty as CTO at Chainletter Labs, where we build blockchain timestamping services for file verification, anti-deepfake tools, and digital certifications.</p>

<p>I've been writing software for about 20 years across startups and small businesses. That breadth tends to mean you end up doing a bit of everything: architecture, test automation, ERP customization, trade show logistics, marketing. Whatever needed to get done.</p>

<p>These days I spend a lot of time working with AI tools and thinking about where they actually fit into a real workflow. Not the hype, just the practical side. LUMP Depot is where I write about that.</p>

<p>You can find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicholas-tantillo-74493b120/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> if you want the full resume version.</p>
